# 11. Events, workflows and integration reliability

## 11.1 Event ownership

CORE-002 remains the event-domain owner.

Every event contract must define:

- Event identity.
- Schema and version.
- Aggregate reference.
- Tenant scope.
- Occurrence time.
- Correlation and causation identity.
- Producer identity.
